OL,3,ARenee Good: Family of US woman killed
OL,4,Aby ICE agent sues Trump officials
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the suits blames the government
OL,7,Ffor her death, claiming the operation
OL,8,Fcreated "an unprecedented environment
OL,9,Ffor state-sponsored violence", a lawyer
OL,10,Ffor the family, Antonio Romanucci, said
OL,11,Fduring a news conference on Thursday.
OL,13,FThe White House and Department of
OL,14,FHomeland Security (DHS) have not yet
OL,15,Fcommented on the lawsuits.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
